  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_9628.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha sido el s&aacute;bado 27 de julio, dentro de la programaci&oacute;n de las fiestas del Salvador, en el recinto multiusos de Onda. La cantante malague&ntilde;a ha desgranado temas de su &uacute;ltimo disco, Las mujeres que habitan en m&iacute;, y otras canciones anteriores.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9545.jpg\" alt=\"img_9545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9548.jpg\" alt=\"img_9548\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9550.jpg\" alt=\"img_9550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9551.jpg\" alt=\"img_9551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9552.jpg\" alt=\"img_9552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9553.jpg\" alt=\"img_9553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9555.jpg\" alt=\"img_9555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9556.jpg\" alt=\"img_9556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertvanesamartinonda/img_9558.jpg\" alt=\"img_9558\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e